cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CoD-MDTwin, please cite this software release and the associated paper."
title: "CoD-MDTwin"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-07-16

authors:
  - family-names: "Manasrah"
    given-names: "Ahmed"
    affiliation: "Yarmouk University"

abstract: >-
  CoD-MDTwin is a Chain-of-Delegation authorization framework for
  cross-domain Industrial Digital Twin agents. The artifact includes
  an eight-service Docker prototype, experiment scripts, processed
  evaluation results, and a 14-lemma Tamarin model.

keywords:
  - "Industrial Digital Twin"
  - "delegated authorization"
  - "Chain-of-Delegation"
  - "verifiable credentials"
  - "capability-based authorization"
  - "Tamarin Prover"
  - "cascading revocation"

license: GPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/Amanasrah78/CoD-MDTwin"
url: "https://github.com/Amanasrah78/CoD-MDTwin"
